  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "遲來一步,搶救寶箱"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "糟了!我們果然來遲了一步!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "不要緊,村中的居民好像都已經先撤走了,只剩下一些戰士還在抵擋獸人的攻勢.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "好極了,寶箱好像都還安然無恙,不知道「火焰之眼」是否.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "你說什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "..沒事!沒事!我們趕快去幫忙吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "沒錯!把那些獸人殺個落花流水!我們上吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/2931e1ff899c/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "哈瓦特老爹參戰"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "我的天啊!這是怎麼一回事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "老..老爹!您怎麼來了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "怎麼?我不能來嗎?我只是來看個老朋友而已..怎麼會變成這樣子?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "獸人大軍來攻,村內的居民好像都逃光了,我們正在迎戰敵軍.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "獸人?這些傢伙是活的不耐煩了?我先來給牠們幾斧頭再說!小子啊,你也要好好幹!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "是的,老爹!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "哈瓦那老爹,歡迎加入!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "..啊,我年紀畢竟是老了,不能太逞強..哈諾,以後你要自己照顧自己了,老爹..不行了.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/2931e1ff899c/scenes/1"
    },
    {
