          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "text": "啊.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "text": "你們消滅不了精靈族的..啊.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "text": "哇啊.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "text": "啊.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "text": "哇啊.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "魔"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "text": "吼嗚!宰了這些傢伙.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/2931e1ff899c/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "精靈蜜致謝,獸人大軍動向"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "text": "你們不是貝克威和珊嗎?還有好久不見的哈瓦那老爹,幸好你們帶了幫手來,要不然我們真會抵擋不住了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "text": "不過,你們又怎麼會知道獸人大軍前來攻擊呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "湊巧啦!還好這些朋友願意幫忙。城中的居民呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "text": "我們事先收到警告,居民都連夜撤到安全的地方去了。不過聽說獸人大軍還在離哈斯米爾不遠的蘭迪平原駐紮,眼前情勢仍然很險惡.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "對了,獸人大軍為何要攻打哈斯米爾?我到現在還是不明白。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蜜"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "text": "這一點我們也不清楚,不過牠們在開戰前曾大聲宣言,要把精靈族殺戮殆盡,為何如此我們並不清楚.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/2931e1ff899c/scenes/3"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "商議先發制人"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "還不簡單!獸人大軍現在不是駐紮在那個什麼平原嗎?我們去把他們殺個人仰馬翻,再抓幾個來問問不就好了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "典型的索爾作風..不過也不失為一個好方法。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "是啊,讓那些獸人繼續待在那裡太危險了,先把牠們在野外殲滅,免得牠們又來進攻。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "正好老爹也來了,我們的戰力大增,要對付那些獸人相信不是難事。老爹,你會和我們一起去吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "當然!就這幾隻獸人,那能讓我過癮呢!再說,我也想看看這些日子以來,小子長進了多少。哈哈哈!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "既然如此,那我們稍事休息之後就出發吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/2931e1ff899c/scenes/4"
    },
    {
