          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "糟糕,精靈們全被消滅了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/1",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/1",
          "text": "年輕人,你們年紀輕輕就有這種武藝,真是了不起!這件重要的寶物絕不能讓它落入獸人的手中,就先拜託你保管了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好的!這是.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/3",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/2931e1ff899c/scenes/5/lines/3",
          "text": "你會發現它的功用的,代替我好好的使用它吧!"
        }
      ],
